{"id":50,"name":"ق","transliteration":"Qaf","translation_fr":"Qaf","translation_en":"The Letter \"Qaf\"","type":"meccan","total_verses":45,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"قٓۚ وَٱلۡقُرۡءَانِ ٱلۡمَجِيدِ","translation_fr":"Qâf. Par le Coran glorieux","translation_en":"Qaf. By the honored Qur'an","transliteration":"Qaf waalqurani almajeedi"},{"id":2,"text":"بَلۡ عَجِبُوٓاْ أَن جَآءَهُم مُّنذِرٞ مِّنۡهُمۡ فَقَالَ ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ هَٰذَا شَيۡءٌ عَجِيبٌ","translation_fr":"Mais ils s'étonnent que l'un des leurs leur vint comme avertisseur; et les mécréants dirent: «Ceci est une chose étonnante","translation_en":"But they wonder that there has come to them a warner from among themselves, and the disbelievers say, \"This is an amazing thing","transliteration":"Bal AAajiboo an jaahum munthirun minhum faqala alkafiroona hatha shayon AAajeebun"},{"id":3,"text":"أَءِذَا مِتۡنَا وَكُنَّا تُرَابٗاۖ ذَٰلِكَ رَجۡعُۢ بَعِيدٞ","translation_fr":"Quoi! Quand nous serons morts et réduits en poussière...? Ce serait revenir de loin!»","translation_en":"When we have died and have become dust, [we will return to life]? That is a distant return","transliteration":"Aitha mitna wakunna turaban thalika rajAAun baAAeedun"},{"id":4,"text":"قَدۡ عَلِمۡنَا مَا تَنقُصُ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ مِنۡهُمۡۖ وَعِندَنَا كِتَٰبٌ حَفِيظُۢ","translation_fr":"Certes, Nous savons ce que la terre rongera d'eux [de leurs corps]; et Nous avons un Livre où tout est conservé","translation_en":"We know what the earth diminishes of them, and with Us is a retaining record","transliteration":"Qad AAalimna ma tanqusu alardu minhum waAAindana kitabun hafeethun"},{"id":5,"text":"بَلۡ كَذَّبُواْ بِٱلۡحَقِّ لَمَّا جَآءَهُمۡ فَهُمۡ فِيٓ أَمۡرٖ مَّرِيجٍ","translation_fr":"Plutôt, ils traitent de mensonge la vérité qui leur est venue: les voilà donc dans une situation confuse","translation_en":"But they denied the truth when it came to them, so they are in a confused condition","transliteration":"Bal kaththaboo bialhaqqi lamma jaahum fahum fee amrin mareejin"},{"id":6,"text":"أَفَلَمۡ يَنظُرُوٓاْ إِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ فَوۡقَهُمۡ كَيۡفَ بَنَيۡنَٰهَا وَزَيَّنَّـٰهَا وَمَا لَهَا مِن فُرُوجٖ","translation_fr":"N'ont-ils donc pas observé le ciel au-dessus d'eux, comment Nous l'avons bâti et embelli; et comment il est sans fissures","translation_en":"Have they not looked at the heaven above them - how We structured it and adorned it and [how] it has no rifts","transliteration":"Afalam yanthuroo ila alssamai fawqahum kayfa banaynaha wazayyannaha wama laha min furoojin"},{"id":7,"text":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ مَدَدۡنَٰهَا وَأَلۡقَيۡنَا فِيهَا رَوَٰسِيَ وَأَنۢبَتۡنَا فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ زَوۡجِۭ بَهِيجٖ","translation_fr":"Et la terre, Nous l'avons étendue et Nous y avons enfoncé fermement des montagnes et y avons fait pousser toutes sortes de magnifiques couples de [végétaux]","translation_en":"And the earth - We spread it out and cast therein firmly set mountains and made grow therein [something] of every beautiful kind","transliteration":"Waalarda madadnaha waalqayna feeha rawasiya waanbatna feeha min kulli zawjin baheejin"},{"id":8,"text":"تَبۡصِرَةٗ وَذِكۡرَىٰ لِكُلِّ عَبۡدٖ مُّنِيبٖ","translation_fr":"à titre d'appel à la clairvoyance et un rappel pour tout serviteur repentant","translation_en":"Giving insight and a reminder for every servant who turns [to Allah]","transliteration":"Tabsiratan wathikra likulli AAabdin muneebin"},{"id":9,"text":"وَنَزَّلۡنَا مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءٗ مُّبَٰرَكٗا فَأَنۢبَتۡنَا بِهِۦ جَنَّـٰتٖ وَحَبَّ ٱلۡحَصِيدِ","translation_fr":"Et Nous avons fait descendre du ciel une eau bénie, avec laquelle Nous avons fait pousser des jardins et le grain qu'on moissonne","translation_en":"And We have sent down blessed rain from the sky and made grow thereby gardens and grain from the harvest","transliteration":"Wanazzalna mina alssamai maan mubarakan faanbatna bihi jannatin wahabba alhaseedi"},{"id":10,"text":"وَٱلنَّخۡلَ بَاسِقَٰتٖ لَّهَا طَلۡعٞ نَّضِيدٞ","translation_fr":"ainsi que les hauts palmiers aux régimes superposés","translation_en":"And lofty palm trees having fruit arranged in layers","transliteration":"Waalnnakhla basiqatin laha talAAun nadeedun"},{"id":11,"text":"رِّزۡقٗا لِّلۡعِبَادِۖ وَأَحۡيَيۡنَا بِهِۦ بَلۡدَةٗ مَّيۡتٗاۚ كَذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡخُرُوجُ","translation_fr":"comme subsistance pour les serviteurs. Et par elle (l'eau) Nous avons redonné la vie à une contrée morte. Ainsi se fera la résurrection","translation_en":"As provision for the servants, and We have given life thereby to a dead land. Thus is the resurrection","transliteration":"Rizqan lilAAibadi waahyayna bihi baldatan maytan kathalika alkhurooju"},{"id":12,"text":"كَذَّبَتۡ قَبۡلَهُمۡ قَوۡمُ نُوحٖ وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلرَّسِّ وَثَمُودُ","translation_fr":"Avant eux, le peuple de Noé, les gens d'Ar-Rass et les Thamûd crièrent au mensonge","translation_en":"The people of Noah denied before them, and the companions of the well and Thamud","transliteration":"Kaththabat qablahum qawmu noohin waashabu alrrassi wathamoodu"},{"id":13,"text":"وَعَادٞ وَفِرۡعَوۡنُ وَإِخۡوَٰنُ لُوطٖ","translation_fr":"de même que les 'Aad et Pharaon et les frères de Lot","translation_en":"And 'Aad and Pharaoh and the brothers of Lot","transliteration":"WaAAadun wafirAAawnu waikhwanu lootin"},{"id":14,"text":"وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡأَيۡكَةِ وَقَوۡمُ تُبَّعٖۚ كُلّٞ كَذَّبَ ٱلرُّسُلَ فَحَقَّ وَعِيدِ","translation_fr":"et les gens d'Al-Aykah et le peuple de Tubba'. Tous traitèrent les Messagers de menteurs. C'est ainsi que Ma menace se justifia","translation_en":"And the companions of the thicket and the people of Tubba'. All denied the messengers, so My threat was justly fulfilled","transliteration":"Waashabu alaykati waqawmu tubbaAAin kullun kaththaba alrrusula fahaqqa waAAeedi"},{"id":15,"text":"أَفَعَيِينَا بِٱلۡخَلۡقِ ٱلۡأَوَّلِۚ بَلۡ هُمۡ فِي لَبۡسٖ مِّنۡ خَلۡقٖ جَدِيدٖ","translation_fr":"Quoi? Avons-Nous été fatigué par la première création? Mais ils sont dans la confusion [au sujet] d'une création nouvelle","translation_en":"Did We fail in the first creation? But they are in confusion over a new creation","transliteration":"AfaAAayeena bialkhalqi alawwali bal hum fee labsin min khalqin jadeedin"},{"id":16,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ خَلَقۡنَا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ وَنَعۡلَمُ مَا تُوَسۡوِسُ بِهِۦ نَفۡسُهُۥۖ وَنَحۡنُ أَقۡرَبُ إِلَيۡهِ مِنۡ حَبۡلِ ٱلۡوَرِيدِ","translation_fr":"Nous avons effectivement créé l'homme et Nous savons ce que son âme lui suggère et Nous sommes plus près de lui que sa veine jugulaire","translation_en":"And We have already created man and know what his soul whispers to him, and We are closer to him than [his] jugular vein","transliteration":"Walaqad khalaqna alinsana wanaAAlamu ma tuwaswisu bihi nafsuhu wanahnu aqrabu ilayhi min habli alwareedi"},{"id":17,"text":"إِذۡ يَتَلَقَّى ٱلۡمُتَلَقِّيَانِ عَنِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ وَعَنِ ٱلشِّمَالِ قَعِيدٞ","translation_fr":"quand les deux recueillants, assis à droite et à gauche, recueillent","translation_en":"When the two receivers receive, seated on the right and on the left","transliteration":"Ith yatalaqqa almutalaqqiyani AAani alyameeni waAAani alshshimali qaAAeedun"},{"id":18,"text":"مَّا يَلۡفِظُ مِن قَوۡلٍ إِلَّا لَدَيۡهِ رَقِيبٌ عَتِيدٞ","translation_fr":"Il ne prononce pas une parole sans avoir auprès de lui un observateur prêt à l'inscrire","translation_en":"Man does not utter any word except that with him is an observer prepared [to record]","transliteration":"Ma yalfithu min qawlin illa ladayhi raqeebun AAateedun"},{"id":19,"text":"وَجَآءَتۡ سَكۡرَةُ ٱلۡمَوۡتِ بِٱلۡحَقِّۖ ذَٰلِكَ مَا كُنتَ مِنۡهُ تَحِيدُ","translation_fr":"L'agonie de la mort fait apparaître la vérité: «Voilà ce dont tu t'écartais»","translation_en":"And the intoxication of death will bring the truth; that is what you were trying to avoid","transliteration":"Wajaat sakratu almawti bialhaqqi thalika ma kunta minhu taheedu"},{"id":20,"text":"وَنُفِخَ فِي ٱلصُّورِۚ ذَٰلِكَ يَوۡمُ ٱلۡوَعِيدِ","translation_fr":"Et l'on soufflera dans la Trompe: Voilà le jour de la Menace","translation_en":"And the Horn will be blown. That is the Day of [carrying out] the threat","transliteration":"Wanufikha fee alssoori thalika yawmu alwaAAeedi"},{"id":21,"text":"وَجَآءَتۡ كُلُّ نَفۡسٖ مَّعَهَا سَآئِقٞ وَشَهِيدٞ","translation_fr":"Alors chaque âme viendra accompagnée d'un conducteur et d'un témoin","translation_en":"And every soul will come, with it a driver and a witness","transliteration":"Wajaat kullu nafsin maAAaha saiqun washaheedun"},{"id":22,"text":"لَّقَدۡ كُنتَ فِي غَفۡلَةٖ مِّنۡ هَٰذَا فَكَشَفۡنَا عَنكَ غِطَآءَكَ فَبَصَرُكَ ٱلۡيَوۡمَ حَدِيدٞ","translation_fr":"«Tu restais indifférent à cela. Et bien, Nous ôtons ton voile; ta vue est perçante aujourd'hui","translation_en":"[It will be said], \"You were certainly in unmindfulness of this, and We have removed from you your cover, so your sight, this Day, is sharp","transliteration":"Laqad kunta fee ghaflatin min hatha fakashafna AAanka ghitaaka fabasaruka alyawma hadeedun"},{"id":23,"text":"وَقَالَ قَرِينُهُۥ هَٰذَا مَا لَدَيَّ عَتِيدٌ","translation_fr":"Et son compagnon dira: «Voilà ce qui est avec moi, tout prêt»","translation_en":"And his companion, [the angel], will say, \"This [record] is what is with me, prepared","transliteration":"Waqala qareenuhu hatha ma ladayya AAateedun"},{"id":24,"text":"أَلۡقِيَا فِي جَهَنَّمَ كُلَّ كَفَّارٍ عَنِيدٖ","translation_fr":"«Vous deux, jetez dans l'Enfer tout mécréant endurci et rebelle","translation_en":"[Allah will say], \"Throw into Hell every obstinate disbeliever","transliteration":"Alqiya fee jahannama kulla kaffarin AAaneedin"},{"id":25,"text":"مَّنَّاعٖ لِّلۡخَيۡرِ مُعۡتَدٖ مُّرِيبٍ","translation_fr":"acharné à empêcher le bien, transgresseur, douteur","translation_en":"Preventer of good, aggressor, and doubter","transliteration":"MannaAAin lilkhayri muAAtadin mureebin"},{"id":26,"text":"ٱلَّذِي جَعَلَ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ إِلَٰهًا ءَاخَرَ فَأَلۡقِيَاهُ فِي ٱلۡعَذَابِ ٱلشَّدِيدِ","translation_fr":"celui qui plaçait à côté d'Allah une autre divinité. Jetez-le donc dans le dur châtiment»","translation_en":"Who made [as equal] with Allah another deity; then throw him into the severe punishment","transliteration":"Allathee jaAAala maAAa Allahi ilahan akhara faalqiyahu fee alAAathabi alshshadeedi"},{"id":27,"text":"۞قَالَ قَرِينُهُۥ رَبَّنَا مَآ أَطۡغَيۡتُهُۥ وَلَٰكِن كَانَ فِي ضَلَٰلِۭ بَعِيدٖ","translation_fr":"Son camarade (le Diable) dira: «Seigneur, ce n'est pas moi qui l'ai fait transgresser; mais il était déjà dans un profond égarement»","translation_en":"His [devil] companion will say, \"Our Lord, I did not make him transgress, but he [himself] was in extreme error","transliteration":"Qala qareenuhu rabbana ma atghaytuhu walakin kana fee dalalin baAAeedin"},{"id":28,"text":"قَالَ لَا تَخۡتَصِمُواْ لَدَيَّ وَقَدۡ قَدَّمۡتُ إِلَيۡكُم بِٱلۡوَعِيدِ","translation_fr":"Alors [Allah] dira:«Ne vous disputez pas devant moi! Alors que Je vous ai déjà fait part de la menace","translation_en":"[Allah] will say, \"Do not dispute before Me, while I had already presented to you the warning","transliteration":"Qala la takhtasimoo ladayya waqad qaddamtu ilaykum bialwaAAeedi"},{"id":29,"text":"مَا يُبَدَّلُ ٱلۡقَوۡلُ لَدَيَّ وَمَآ أَنَا۠ بِظَلَّـٰمٖ لِّلۡعَبِيدِ","translation_fr":"Chez Moi, la parole ne change pas; et Je n'opprime nullement les serviteurs»","translation_en":"The word will not be changed with Me, and never will I be unjust to the servants","transliteration":"Ma yubaddalu alqawlu ladayya wama ana bithallamin lilAAabeedi"},{"id":30,"text":"يَوۡمَ نَقُولُ لِجَهَنَّمَ هَلِ ٱمۡتَلَأۡتِ وَتَقُولُ هَلۡ مِن مَّزِيدٖ","translation_fr":"Le jour où Nous dirons à l'Enfer; «Es-tu rempli?» Il dira: «Y en a-t-il encore?»","translation_en":"On the Day We will say to Hell, \"Have you been filled?\" and it will say, \"Are there some more","transliteration":"Yawma naqoolu lijahannama hali imtalati wataqoolu hal min mazeedin"},{"id":31,"text":"وَأُزۡلِفَتِ ٱلۡجَنَّةُ لِلۡمُتَّقِينَ غَيۡرَ بَعِيدٍ","translation_fr":"Le Paradis sera rapproché à proximité des pieux","translation_en":"And Paradise will be brought near to the righteous, not far","transliteration":"Waozlifati aljannatu lilmuttaqeena ghayra baAAeedin"},{"id":32,"text":"هَٰذَا مَا تُوعَدُونَ لِكُلِّ أَوَّابٍ حَفِيظٖ","translation_fr":"«Voilà ce qui vous a été promis, [ainsi qu'] à tout homme plein de repentir et respectueux [des prescriptions divines]","translation_en":"[It will be said], \"This is what you were promised - for every returner [to Allah] and keeper [of His covenant]","transliteration":"Hatha ma tooAAadoona likulli awwabin hafeethin"},{"id":33,"text":"مَّنۡ خَشِيَ ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنَ بِٱلۡغَيۡبِ وَجَآءَ بِقَلۡبٖ مُّنِيبٍ","translation_fr":"qui redoute le Tout Miséricordieux bien qu'il ne Le voit pas, et qui vient [vers Lui] avec un cœur porté à l'obéissance","translation_en":"Who feared the Most Merciful unseen and came with a heart returning [in repentance]","transliteration":"Man khashiya alrrahmana bialghaybi wajaa biqalbin muneebin"},{"id":34,"text":"ٱدۡخُلُوهَا بِسَلَٰمٖۖ ذَٰلِكَ يَوۡمُ ٱلۡخُلُودِ","translation_fr":"Entrez-y en toute sécurité,». Voilà le jour de l'éternité","translation_en":"Enter it in peace. This is the Day of Eternity","transliteration":"Odkhulooha bisalamin thalika yawmu alkhuloodi"},{"id":35,"text":"لَهُم مَّا يَشَآءُونَ فِيهَا وَلَدَيۡنَا مَزِيدٞ","translation_fr":"Il y aura là pour eux tout ce qu'ils voudront. Et auprès de Nous il y a davantage encore","translation_en":"They will have whatever they wish therein, and with Us is more","transliteration":"Lahum ma yashaoona feeha waladayna mazeedun"},{"id":36,"text":"وَكَمۡ أَهۡلَكۡنَا قَبۡلَهُم مِّن قَرۡنٍ هُمۡ أَشَدُّ مِنۡهُم بَطۡشٗا فَنَقَّبُواْ فِي ٱلۡبِلَٰدِ هَلۡ مِن مَّحِيصٍ","translation_fr":"combien avons-Nous fait périr, avant eux, de générations bien plus fortes qu'eux. Ils avaient parcouru les contrées, cherchant [vainement] où fuir","translation_en":"And how many a generation before them did We destroy who were greater than them in [striking] power and had explored throughout the lands. Is there any place of escape","transliteration":"Wakam ahlakna qablahum min qarnin hum ashaddu minhum batshan fanaqqaboo fee albiladi hal min maheesin"},{"id":37,"text":"إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَذِكۡرَىٰ لِمَن كَانَ لَهُۥ قَلۡبٌ أَوۡ أَلۡقَى ٱلسَّمۡعَ وَهُوَ شَهِيدٞ","translation_fr":"Il y a bien là un rappel pour quiconque a un cœur, prête l'oreille tout en étant témoin","translation_en":"Indeed in that is a reminder for whoever has a heart or who listens while he is present [in mind]","transliteration":"Inna fee thalika lathikra liman kana lahu qalbun aw alqa alssamAAa wahuwa shaheedun"},{"id":38,"text":"وَلَقَدۡ خَلَقۡنَا ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَا فِي سِتَّةِ أَيَّامٖ وَمَا مَسَّنَا مِن لُّغُوبٖ","translation_fr":"En effet Nous avons créé les cieux et la terre et ce qui existe entre eux en six jours, sans éprouver la moindre lassitude","translation_en":"And We did certainly create the heavens and earth and what is between them in six days, and there touched Us no weariness","transliteration":"Walaqad khalaqna alssamawati waalarda wama baynahuma fee sittati ayyamin wama massana min lughoobin"},{"id":39,"text":"فَٱصۡبِرۡ عَلَىٰ مَا يَقُولُونَ وَسَبِّحۡ بِحَمۡدِ رَبِّكَ قَبۡلَ طُلُوعِ ٱلشَّمۡسِ وَقَبۡلَ ٱلۡغُرُوبِ","translation_fr":"Endure donc ce qu'ils disent; et célèbre la louange de ton Seigneur avant le lever du soleil et avant [son] coucher","translation_en":"So be patient, [O Muhammad], over what they say and exalt [Allah] with praise of your Lord before the rising of the sun and before its setting","transliteration":"Faisbir AAala ma yaqooloona wasabbih bihamdi rabbika qabla tulooAAi alshshamsi waqabla alghuroobi"},{"id":40,"text":"وَمِنَ ٱلَّيۡلِ فَسَبِّحۡهُ وَأَدۡبَٰرَ ٱلسُّجُودِ","translation_fr":"et célèbre Sa gloire, une partie de la nuit et à la suite des prosternations [prières]","translation_en":"And [in part] of the night exalt Him and after prostration","transliteration":"Wamina allayli fasabbihhu waadbara alssujoodi"},{"id":41,"text":"وَٱسۡتَمِعۡ يَوۡمَ يُنَادِ ٱلۡمُنَادِ مِن مَّكَانٖ قَرِيبٖ","translation_fr":"Et sois à l'écoute, le jour où le Crieur criera d'un endroit proche","translation_en":"And listen on the Day when the Caller will call out from a place that is near","transliteration":"WaistamiAA yawma yunadi almunadi min makanin qareebin"},{"id":42,"text":"يَوۡمَ يَسۡمَعُونَ ٱلصَّيۡحَةَ بِٱلۡحَقِّۚ ذَٰلِكَ يَوۡمُ ٱلۡخُرُوجِ","translation_fr":"le jour où ils entendront en toute vérité le Cri. Voilà le Jour de la Résurrection","translation_en":"The Day they will hear the blast [of the Horn] in truth. That is the Day of Emergence [from the graves]","transliteration":"Yawma yasmaAAoona alssayhata bialhaqqi thalika yawmu alkhurooji"},{"id":43,"text":"إِنَّا نَحۡنُ نُحۡيِۦ وَنُمِيتُ وَإِلَيۡنَا ٱلۡمَصِيرُ","translation_fr":"C'est Nous qui donnons la vie et donnons la mort, et vers Nous sera la destination","translation_en":"Indeed, it is We who give life and cause death, and to Us is the destination","transliteration":"Inna nahnu nuhyee wanumeetu wailayna almaseeru"},{"id":44,"text":"يَوۡمَ تَشَقَّقُ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ عَنۡهُمۡ سِرَاعٗاۚ ذَٰلِكَ حَشۡرٌ عَلَيۡنَا يَسِيرٞ","translation_fr":"le jour où la terre se fendra, les [rejetant] précipitamment. Ce sera un rassemblement facile pour Nous","translation_en":"On the Day the earth breaks away from them [and they emerge] rapidly; that is a gathering easy for Us","transliteration":"Yawma tashaqqaqu alardu AAanhum siraAAan thalika hashrun AAalayna yaseerun"},{"id":45,"text":"نَّحۡنُ أَعۡلَمُ بِمَا يَقُولُونَۖ وَمَآ أَنتَ عَلَيۡهِم بِجَبَّارٖۖ فَذَكِّرۡ بِٱلۡقُرۡءَانِ مَن يَخَافُ وَعِيدِ","translation_fr":"Nous savons mieux ce qu'ils disent. Tu n'as pas pour mission d'exercer sur eux une contrainte. Rappelle donc, par le Coran celui qui craint Ma menace","translation_en":"We are most knowing of what they say, and you are not over them a tyrant. But remind by the Qur'an whoever fears My threat","transliteration":"Nahnu aAAlamu bima yaqooloona wama anta AAalayhim bijabbarin fathakkir bialqurani man yakhafu waAAeedi"}]}